---
import { lifestyle } from '../data/site';
---

<section class="real-stories section-shell" aria-labelledby="people-heading">
  <div class="section-kicker">
    <span class="eyebrow">05 / THE REASON WE MAKE THEM</span>
    <span class="eyebrow">GOOD GIFTS GET PERSONAL.</span>
  </div>
  <h2 id="people-heading">
    MADE FOR PEOPLE.
    <br />
    <span class="muted">NOT SHELVES.</span>
  </h2>
  <div class="stories-layout">
    <figure class="story-main-image">
      <img
        src={lifestyle.main.src}
        alt={lifestyle.main.alt}
        width="1536"
        height="1024"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <figcaption>
        <span>THE BIG DAYS. THE LITTLE DETAILS.</span>
        <span>01 / BIRTHDAYS</span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="story-aside">
      <p>
        It’s never
        <br />
        just a <em>can.</em>
      </p>
      <figure class="story-secondary-image">
        <img
          src={lifestyle.secondary.src}
          alt={lifestyle.secondary.alt}
          width="1122"
          height="1402"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <figcaption>02 / TOGETHER</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="story-aside-copy">
        <p>
          It’s “I saw this and thought of you.”
          <br />
          It’s that joke from three summers ago.
          <br />
          It’s a little reminder that someone gets you.
        </p>
        <a href="#personalize" class="text-link">
          MAKE SOMEONE’S DAY{' '}
          <svg class="arrow-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
